  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK av svenska SPO om alternativa betalv&#xE4;gar 2022-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Management and Controll of SPO for Alternative Payments 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida planerar att utv&#xE4;rdera 9 strategiska partnerorganisationer, inom Sidas st&#xF6;d till civilsamh&#xE4;llesutveckling. Organisationerna f&#xE5;r programst&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida med tillst&#xE5;nd f&#xF6;r vidaref&#xF6;rmedling. Sidas plan &#xE4;r att forts&#xE4;tta sitt st&#xF6;d till dessa organisationer i framtiden och vill g&#xF6;ra det m&#xF6;jligt f&#xF6;r dem att n&#xE5; ut till sm&#xE5; r&#xF6;relser i sammanhang med krympande samh&#xE4;llsutrymme och ibland med hinder f&#xF6;r att anv&#xE4;nda det formella banksystemet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida plans to evaluate 9 strategic partner organisations, within Sida&apos;s support for civil society development. The organizations receive program support from Sida with permission for further transmission. Sida&apos;s plan is to continue its support to these organizations in the future and wants to enable them to reach out to small movements in contexts with shrinking social space and sometimes with obstacles to using the formal banking system.</narrative>
  </description>
